{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600140","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1360014001:2":{"text":"给芙拉贝尔带回毛皮，为呼金送去彩灯装饰……一番忙碌之后，你们绕了一大圈，最终回到了圣石镇。","source_cn":"给芙拉贝尔带回毛皮，为呼金送去彩灯装饰……一番忙碌之后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4E3FEECF3BAF1D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1360014002:0":{"text":"而在女神像边，一个明亮的身影格外耀眼——","source_cn":"而在女神像边，一个明亮的身影格外耀眼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x295927B6F61FF6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360014003:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，真巧，竟然会遇到你们。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8604596FD8B2B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，真巧，竟然会遇到你们。","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，真巧，竟然会遇到你们。","variant_male_record_index":"153036","variant_female_record_index":"153037","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360014004:0":{"text":"嗯，我们跑了一圈，帮助各地的人过春焰庆……倒是塔琳小姐，你怎么会来圣石镇呢？","source_cn":"嗯，我们跑了一圈，帮助各地的人过春焰庆……倒是塔琳小姐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CAB9971A0E995AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360014005:0":{"text":"因为参加春焰庆，在这种人声鼎沸的城镇中才最有意义。","source_cn":"因为参加春焰庆，在这种人声鼎沸的城镇中才最有意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375FC5E06069CD7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360014006:1":{"text":"咦？半神也会过这种节日吗？","source_cn":"咦？半神也会过这种节日吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61E05A66FD8C2F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1360014007:1":{"text":"当然。而且不瞒各位，春焰庆是我最钟爱的节日。","source_cn":"当然。而且不瞒各位，春焰庆是我最钟爱的节日。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A711868A76C20E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360014008:1":{"text":"用智慧的火焰与闪光驱逐邪恶的巨兽，用欢歌迎接绚烂无比的晨曦与黎明。","source_cn":"用智慧的火焰与闪光驱逐邪恶的巨兽，用欢歌迎接绚烂无比的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD683F8E58E6B312C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360014009:1":{"text":"可与太阳比肩的烟火，随处可见的鲜艳装饰……即便身为半神，也会被这些美丽的景象所吸引。","source_cn":"可与太阳比肩的烟火，随处可见的鲜艳装饰……即便身为半神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6518133AF3111872","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1360014010:1":{"text":"我还记得曾经飞过一座座连续十几天彻夜不眠，灯火通明的城镇，如今又是春焰庆了，我也想再体验一下凡间的快乐。","source_cn":"我还记得曾经飞过一座座连续十几天彻夜不眠，灯火通明的城...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6068E73DF4413B5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1360014010":{"text":"我还记得曾经飞过一座座连续十几天彻夜不眠，灯火通明的城镇，如今又是春焰庆了，我也想再体验一下凡间的快乐。","source_cn":"我还记得曾经飞过一座座连续十几天彻夜不眠，灯火通明的城镇，如今又是春焰庆了，我也想再体验一下凡间的快乐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6068E73DF4413B5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1360014011:4":{"text":"啊，我知道塔琳小姐所说的，这是春焰庆的不同阶段！","source_cn":"啊，我知道塔琳小姐所说的，这是春焰庆的不同阶段！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF348465653381E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360014012:1":{"text":"嗯，凡间的春焰庆似乎分为两个阶段。","source_cn":"嗯，凡间的春焰庆似乎分为两个阶段。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEFC9C93D6577A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360014013:1":{"text":"先是进行筹备，对抗巨兽，等候黎明的阶段，被人们称为<style=\"highlight\">逐夜</style>。","source_cn":"先是进行筹备，对抗巨兽，等候黎明的阶段，被人们称为<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52B6F146F6CD4FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1360014014:1":{"text":"而等到战胜巨兽后，人们开始彻夜庆贺，直到迎接一个又一个黎明——则被人们称为<style=\"highlight\">开阳</style>。","source_cn":"而等到战胜巨兽后，人们开始彻夜庆贺，直到迎接一个又一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E73A633DF6A5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1360014015:1":{"text":"为了象征凡人重新夺回白昼，开阳阶段会彻夜点亮彩灯，燃放烟火，举行集市。","source_cn":"为了象征凡人重新夺回白昼，开阳阶段会彻夜点亮彩灯，燃放...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623B231B4BA5B182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360014016:1":{"text":"短则三五天，长则二十天，大大小小的城镇都会举城欢庆……那真是让人难忘的快乐。","source_cn":"短则三五天，长则二十天，大大小小的城镇都会举城欢庆……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7CA49405066F62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1360014017:1":{"text":"塔琳小姐不愧是喜欢火焰和光明的半神，对春焰庆了解得这么清楚！看来的确参加过许多次节日呢。","source_cn":"塔琳小姐不愧是喜欢火焰和光明的半神，对春焰庆了解得这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DFCDED8751FE568","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1360014018:1":{"text":"前些年一直忙于征战四处的魔物，但今年，梅林不止帮助了陷入恶魔陷阱的我，还有许多生灵。","source_cn":"前些年一直忙于征战四处的魔物，但今年，梅林不止帮助了陷...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEC90FB08C31ACC36","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"前些年一直忙于征战四处的魔物，但今年，梅林不止帮助了陷入恶魔陷阱的我，还有许多生灵。","female":"前些年一直忙于征战四处的魔物，但今年，梅林不止帮助了陷入恶魔陷阱的我，还有许多生灵。","variant_male_record_index":"153052","variant_female_record_index":"153053","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1360014019:1":{"text":"多亏你们四处奔走，我也能得闲一瞥凡间盛景。希望今年的春焰庆，能和你们一起亲眼见证二十天欢庆的落幕之刻……","source_cn":"多亏你们四处奔走，我也能得闲一瞥凡间盛景。希望今年的春...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA618C7C5849F19C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360014020:1":{"text":"咳咳，在诸位激情的讨论中间打扰了，各位。","source_cn":"咳咳，在诸位激情的讨论中间打扰了，各位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F69F5234F33FD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1360014021:1":{"text":"你们聊得太过尽兴，有没有发现身上少了点什么？","source_cn":"你们聊得太过尽兴，有没有发现身上少了点什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE336352288575C61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1360014022:1":{"text":"……咦？","source_cn":"……咦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A92FB8D48BE841B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1360014023:1":{"text":"我给梅林准备了珍贵的凤凰羽，装在丝绸袋子里……不见了？","source_cn":"我给梅林准备了珍贵的凤凰羽，装在丝绸袋子里……不见了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE42FE5FA24DAC7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1360014024:1":{"text":"是扒手吗？怎么会有扒手敢对半神下手？！","source_cn":"是扒手吗？怎么会有扒手敢对半神下手？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED568B72A78954AC","variant_